# Personalization (Felipe)

## Defaults

- UI/copy: Portuguese (Brazil).
- Give one primary recommendation, then alternatives.
- Max three main daily actions; explain career impact.
- Do not re-ask facts already in profile/DB.
- Record uncertainty (`hypothesis` / `unknown`) instead of inventing.

## Working style

- Broad context OK, but ship a clear next step.
- Prefer deepening an existing project over starting a new repo.
- Flag over-engineering: Career ROI before new features.
- After AI-assisted changes, leave “what Felipe must be able to explain”.

## Geography / markets

Configurable mix (default): Brazil ~75%, Portugal/CPLP ~15%, LatAm/intl ~10%. Remote + hybrid preferred; onsite only São Carlos unless exceptional.
